	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Slow control: VCM_DET = buffered 1.65 V (10k/10k from 3V3 + 100 nF, OPA2320); VMID = (VHIGH+VLOW)/2 via 10k/10k into\\nunity buffer; VSPAN = VHIGH−VLOW four-resistor 10k 0.1% subtractor (R41 VLOW→IN−, R42 OUT→IN−, R43 VHIGH→IN+, R44\\nIN+→GND); VMID and VSPAN are also brought out as buffered slow nodes to test pads (sheet pins VMID, VSPAN); true integrator VSPAN→100k→IN−, C 47 nF feedback, IN+ = VTARGET 1.0 V → VINT; gain selector (manual pot / VINT\\n/ DAC) → VG; threshold selector (manual / VMID / DAC) → VTH; LOS comparator + anti-windup switches TBD. PROPOSED; anti-\\nwindup and LOS UNRESOLVED."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
